                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b12108ca-833d-33c4-831a-049bd13a3fd8",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The stock of a family; a race or generation of progenitors."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc366293-a19a-4ed9-9a81-28576c8b3c86",
                                                "sense_id": "b12108ca-833d-33c4-831a-049bd13a3fd8",
                                                "text": "Where ye may all that are of noble ſtemm / Approach, and kiſs her ſacred veſtures hemm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "067acc04-a7f3-4d8f-998a-fda7ce839d16",
                                                "sense_id": "b12108ca-833d-33c4-831a-049bd13a3fd8",
                                                "text": "While I do pray, learn here thy stem / And true descent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3bf94dd-dd2f-3179-83f4-398394eee500",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A branch of a family."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7819c4de-3a86-4980-829f-f3ffa46aa804",
                                                "sense_id": "b3bf94dd-dd2f-3179-83f4-398394eee500",
                                                "text": "This is a stem / Of that victorious stock."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2b89928-21d8-3243-be15-82f85ef7e0e4",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A branch of a family.",
                                            "A branch, or group of branches, located outside a family or other cladistic group, but which is more closely related to that group than to any other taxon of the same rank."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2422aa08-0744-3dae-a750-4bfbc221f2f0",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advanced or leading position; the lookout."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92e30314-5c36-4f1d-8573-7584ca63587f",
                                                "sense_id": "2422aa08-0744-3dae-a750-4bfbc221f2f0",
                                                "text": "Wolsey sat at the stem more than twenty years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "445d53c0-1bbf-3252-8afb-7ca29323d7a0",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The above-ground stalk (technically axis) of a vascular plant, and certain anatomically similar, below-ground organs such as rhizomes, bulbs, tubers, and corms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffe762ff-8df4-417b-b2b8-321ebd186579",
                                                "sense_id": "445d53c0-1bbf-3252-8afb-7ca29323d7a0",
                                                "text": "After they are shot up thirty feet in length, they spread a very large top, having no bough nor twig in the trunk or the stem."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d55e88b6-cef9-4663-956f-d3cb9809023c",
                                                "sense_id": "445d53c0-1bbf-3252-8afb-7ca29323d7a0",
                                                "text": "He had placed her upon the grass by now, her back resting against the stem of a huge tree. At her question he stepped back where he could the better see her face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4974251-ed0a-33d6-9fd6-d67077903cd6",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A slender supporting member of an individual part of a plant such as a flower or a leaf; also, by analogy, the shaft of a feather."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35fdf549-94eb-4279-b74e-f68f4a2637b4",
                                                "sense_id": "a4974251-ed0a-33d6-9fd6-d67077903cd6",
                                                "text": "the stem of an apple or a cherry"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e228b326-11a9-4bd1-8f30-765caf9d7f23",
                                                "sense_id": "a4974251-ed0a-33d6-9fd6-d67077903cd6",
                                                "text": "Earless ghost swift moths become “invisible” to echolocating bats by forming mating clusters close (less than half a meter) above vegetation and effectively blending into the clutter of echoes that the bat receives from the leaves and stems around them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b3ddcb0-ba3a-3a35-a8b3-40dbfa450d86",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A narrow part on certain man-made objects, such as a wine glass, a tobacco pipe, a spoon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdf815a2-415c-34cc-8deb-c7a1d0669217",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The main part of an uninflected word to which affixes may be added to form inflections of the word. A stem often has a more fundamental root. Systematic conjugations and declensions derive from their stems."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd1f99de-1170-4e0c-a098-8e76831da005",
                                                "sense_id": "cdf815a2-415c-34cc-8deb-c7a1d0669217",
                                                "text": "The praenomen and nomen for the most part consisted of simple stems with the suffix -us or -ius, which correspond to some of the contracted forms in other languages […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae8a5f79-c450-3c39-89d1-ceb4c884b7b2",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person's leg."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09d0e083-42fe-468f-af8b-11ec51ab8304",
                                                "sense_id": "ae8a5f79-c450-3c39-89d1-ceb4c884b7b2",
                                                "text": "She was perfectly, fuckably proportioned everywhere else, both above and below her waist. A pocket-size Venus, with the longest stems he'd ever seen on someone so dang diminutive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "636e1556-8926-319e-a0ae-28c2354764aa",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bfdee5c-6350-4a22-8fb0-2c984ab3b0a0",
                                                "sense_id": "636e1556-8926-319e-a0ae-28c2354764aa",
                                                "text": "Waves of ecstasy roll through him as the moustachioed Casanova slides his stem in and out of the spaced-out chick."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fb62736-853b-303a-8964-6365dcd69f31",
                                        "entry_id": "4de9c5b5-9653-3384-97eb-5b9e060305b2",
