                                                "sense_id": "80d7aded-304b-3dd9-bf0f-c4289049b5b5",
                                                "text": "Nor is the pre-eminent tremendousness of the great Sperm Whale anywhere more feelingly comprehended, than on board of those prows which stem him."
                                            }
