                                                "sense_id": "068183d1-052e-39bb-bcf6-438e25730f6f",
                                                "text": "As when two warlike Brigandines at sea, / With murdrous weapons arm'd to cruell fight, / Doe meete together on the watry lea, / They stemme ech other with so fell despight, / That with the shocke of their owne heedlesse might, / Their wooden ribs are shaken nigh a sonder […]"
